      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLUFFY'S GIRL (7) has been placed in 2 of her 3 starts this prep at Launceston, finishing second by a head there just over 2 weeks ago. The slight rise in class will hold no fears for her, and the key this time will be having top hoop Anthony Darmanin in the saddle for the first time. On top for us. ALPINE THUNDER (1) is a bold front running gelding who has been racing in good form in tougher fields than what he meets here. He has a 4kg claiming apprentice to offset his sharp weight rise, and if he can find the top from his wide gate, then he can take them all the way. MAKE A DECISION (2) is a durable veteran resuming from a spell without any public trials. He may need this hit-out, but he benefits from a 4kg claim, and is worth keeping safe. STREET DIVA (3) rattled home late to finish third here 12 days ago, and has raced her way into fitness, She is peaking at the right time, drops in weight, and can figure in the top 4 again. TASSIE POWER (4) strips fitter, and is not out of this.",
